abstract: >-
  PECC is a literature-derived prey energy-density database and hierarchical
  assignment workflow for estimating energetic contributions of prey in fish
  stomach-content studies.
keywords:
  - prey energy density
  - stomach contents
  - feeding ecology
  - trophic ecology
  - bioenergetics
  - diet analysis
  - PECC
